        "Expense management software is a system where employees record money they spent on the company’s behalf, attach proof, and get it approved and reimbursed under written rules. It becomes necessary the moment reimbursements stop fitting in one person’s head: usually when you have field staff, more than one approving manager, or an accountant who spends the first week of every month chasing bills.",
